    ASSEMBLY STACK (approximate world Z):
      Ground                        z = 0
      Tracer base_link centre       z = 0.22  (wheel radius ~0.13 m)
      Tracer top deck (local z)     z_local = +0.16
      pedestal_Bottom origin        z_world ~ 0.38
      pedestal_Top surface          z_local = +0.75 within pedestal_Top body
      openarm_body_link0 origin     attached at pedestal_Top pos="0 0 0.75"

    The entire pedestal+arms assembly moves with the Tracer because
    pedestal_Bottom is a child of base_link (no joint = welded).
